<h3>Installation of full MaBoSS environment</h3>
	<ol>
	  <li class="vspace">Download the archive file <a href="pub/MaBoSS-env-2.0.tgz" class="clean-link">MaBoSS-env-2.0.tgz</a></li>
	  <li class="vspace">Untar the archive file as follows:<pre>tar xvfz MaBoSS-env-2.0.tgz</pre>  
	    note that the <span class="tt">MaBoSS-env-2.0</span> subdirectory will be created.
	  </li>
	  <li class="vspace">Compile MaBoSS (see README file for configuration requirements)  :
<pre>cd MaBoSS-env-2.0/src
make install</pre>
The executable file will be located in <span class="tt">MaBoSS-env-2.0/pub</span> and is named MaBoSS.
<p>Note that if your OS is compatible with one of the binary files available in <span class="tt">MaBoSS-env-2.0/binaries</span> subdirectory, you can simply copy it to <span class="tt">MaBoSS-env-2.0/pub</span> without compilation.</p>
	  </li>
	  <li class="vspace">For using MaBoSS environment in a terminal session, go in the <span class="tt">MaBoSS-env-2.0</tt> directory and run
<pre>
  source ./MaBoSS.env
</pre>
</li>
</ol>
