		  <li><span class="tt">file_out_run.txt</span>
		  <br>This file contains a summary of MaBoSS simulation run</li>
		</ul>
	      </li>
	    </ul>
	  </li>
	  <li>Import output files in Excel or R and generate your graphs</li>
	</ol>
	You will find more information in <a href="pub/maboss-refcard_2.0.pdf" class="list">MaBoSS Reference Card</a> and in <a href="pub/DescriptionOutputFile.pdf" class="list">Description of MaBoSS output csv files</a>.
